  "change": "Up to v1.3 the rules said a countered card was not played at all. v1.4 keeps that play-triggers do not fire, but adds that checks of whether a card was played look at whether it was Finalized, with the example that a spell countered by Defy still turns on Legion. Old answer: no. Current: yes.",
